  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed side extension, with particular reference to its excessive width and\r\nlack of a clear visual gap to the side boundary at first floor level, the awkward\r\nparapet wall and box gutter design and loss of original eaves/overhang, is\r\nconsidered an incongruous, poor quality and cramped design that fails to\r\nintegrate with the property overall and the surrounding pattern of development. This is considered\r\ncontrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2021), Policy D3 Policy of the London Plan (2021); CS.1 of the\r\nHarrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Plan\r\nLocal Policies (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document:\r\nResidential Design Guide (2010).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
